<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1400s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 15th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1400s, 1,117 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 237 were founded and 214 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Ottoman Empire, the Republic of Venice and the Ming Empire.</p></header>
